                          "every WHERE arm incl. the raw IN-list and account filter, "
                          "count_if per flag with the OR-composite function_recipe, "
                          "the single-name LISTAGG(distinct) (>1 distinct matched "
                          "name is refused as non-deterministic), and the LIVE "
